"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/RetryByCountStrategy","text":"RetryByCountStrategy","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent20RetryByCountStrategyC"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"E"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Equatable","preciseIdentifier":"s:SQ"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"E"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Error","preciseIdentifier":"s:s5ErrorP"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"retries","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The maximum number of times to retry the upstream, defaulting to 1."}]}]},{"name":"error","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The specific error that should trigger a retry.","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Return Value","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"code":"AsyncSequence","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" that emits the same output as the upstream but retries on the specified error up to the specified number of times.","type":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This method returns an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncSequence"},{"text":" that retries the upstream only when the specified error occurs, up to the given number of retries.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Not all "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncSequence"},{"type":"text","text":"s can be retried. For example, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncStream"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncThrowingStream"},{"type":"text","tex